exports[`scan report > preserves the pre-plugin axe-only report bytes for a local result fixture > axe-only Markdown 1`] = `
"# A11yGate site scan — https://site.test/

**Verdict: FAIL** (fail on: serious)

3 findings at or above serious: image-alt, color-contrast, label.

| Severity | Findings |
| --- | --- |
| critical | 2 |
| serious | 1 |
| moderate | 1 |
| minor | 0 |
| unknown | 0 |

Scanned: 2026-11-12T10:00:00.000Z. Pages analysed: 2; failed: 1. axe-core 4.14.0; A11yGate 0.1.0.

## Pages

| Page | HTTP | Status | Findings |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| https://site.test/ | 200 | complete | 2 |
| https://site.test/about | 200 | complete | 2 |
| https://site.test/gone | 404 | failed — HTTP 404 | 0 |

## Findings by WCAG criterion

### WCAG 1.1.1 Non-text Content (A); EN 301 549 9.1.1.1

- **image-alt** (critical) on \`https://site.test/\` — \`img\` — Images must have alternative text — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/image-alt)

### WCAG 1.3.1 Info and Relationships (A); EN 301 549 9.1.3.1

- **label** (critical) on \`https://site.test/about\` — \`input\` — Form elements must have labels — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/label)

### WCAG 1.4.3 Contrast (Minimum) (AA); EN 301 549 9.1.4.3

- **color-contrast** (serious) on \`https://site.test/about\` — \`p.faint\` — Contrast — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/color-contrast)

### WCAG 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value (A); EN 301 549 9.4.1.2

- **label** (critical) on \`https://site.test/about\` — \`input\` — Form elements must have labels — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/label)

### Best practice (no WCAG success criterion mapped)

- **region** (moderate) on \`https://site.test/\` — \`div\` — Content in landmarks — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/region)

## Findings by severity

### critical (2)

- **image-alt** (critical) on \`https://site.test/\` — \`img\` — Images must have alternative text — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/image-alt)
- **label** (critical) on \`https://site.test/about\` — \`input\` — Form elements must have labels — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/label)

### serious (1)

- **color-contrast** (serious) on \`https://site.test/about\` — \`p.faint\` — Contrast — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/color-contrast)

### moderate (1)

- **region** (moderate) on \`https://site.test/\` — \`div\` — Content in landmarks — [rule guidance](https://dequeuniversity.com/rules/axe/4.14/region)

## Not scanned

- https://site.test/private/ — disallowed by robots.txt

## Scope and boundaries

- Only scan sites you own or are explicitly authorized to test.
- Automated testing only: axe-core detects a subset of WCAG issues. Absence of findings is not conformance, certification or legal advice.
- Read-only: pages were loaded without logging in, filling forms or clicking. Authenticated areas, interactions and dynamic states are unassessed.
- Only same-origin pages reachable through a\\[href\\] links \\(at most 20\\) were visited; robots.txt Disallow rules were honoured.

Automated checks cover only part of WCAG; this is evidence, not certification.
Informational only. Not legal advice. Not a certification of EAA compliance.
"
`;
